 * 2. Attempt to create memberPreference without `member_id` and expect error
 * 3. Attempt POST with empty body and expect error
 * 4. Attempt POST with all optional fields but no `member_id` and expect error
 * 5. Attempt POST with member_id: null and expect error
 * 6. (By design, all cases above are validation failures and create no record)
