 * 2. Create a (dummy) post ID, create a comment authored by this member on that post.
 * 3. Create a valid comment vote (vote_type: "up") for the member+comment pair (should succeed).
 * 4. Attempt to create another vote for the same member+comment pair (should fail with unique constraint error).
 * 5. Try to create a vote with an invalid vote_type value (e.g., "INVALID_TYPE"). Validate error.
 * 6. Try to create a vote with non-existent comment ID (random uuid). Validate error.
 * 7. Try to create a vote with non-existent member ID (random uuid). Validate error.
 *
 * (The scenario states deletion and then re-creation of vote, but no DELETE API is present for commentVotes, so that part will be omitted.)
